commit d747311a9078aad859153b4dba372619eff375ab

C03: a recalled record is said in the second person, never as BAXY's own (MEMORY1601)

MEMORY1599 measured that a save and its recall run and verify in the same profile, but the recall finals said the person's own datum in the first person: «Como me llamo» → «Me llamo Valentina.», «que me gusta tomar.» → «Me gusta tomar mate.». For a verified memory.recall with records, the composer now instructs the recorded value exactly as stored, addressed to the person in the second person («te llamás …», «te gusta …», «your name is …»), and rejects a draft that opens in the first person («me llamo», «me gusta», «mi bebida favorita es», «my name is», «I like») as recalled_as_own, with a hint that names the second person.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


